WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.829
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is no longer

00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:08.850
allowed to offer the solution of "Use more
guns" to any problem!

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.059
Dr. Bright.

00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:11.059
Look at me.

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:13.330
We went over this before, with the chainsaws.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:14.330
Do you remember?

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.789
Do we really need to do this again?

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:17.369
I guess so.

00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:21.570
We face a wide variety of problems here at
the Foundation, of varying degrees of severity.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:26.750
There is no one-size-fits-all solution for
these problems, and even if there was, it

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.140
would not be "use more guns," or "get bigger
guns."

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:34.610
This includes but is not limited to: old-fashioned
dueling pistols, machine guns, or something

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:40.140
called the "octo-gun" which my notes say was
just eight guns taped together...?

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.140
How does that even work?

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.690
Never mind, don't answer that.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.190
The point is, it's not helpful.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.040
And Dr. Bright is not allowed in the armory.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.980
Not even on his birthday.

